# Minimal PaperQA2 runtime/test smoke requirements for the fixed upstream tree.
# Package roots mirror pyproject.toml [project].dependencies; PyPDF mirrors
# packages/paper-qa-pypdf/pyproject.toml. The checkout itself is imported via
# PYTHONPATH (never installed editable, to avoid setuptools_scm changing version.py).
# Keep pytest support to the offline smoke and lightweight upstream collection;
# do not install broad dev extras or model weights in this runtime.
